{"schemaVersion":"uapt-school-change-events-v2","revision":"v6-qs101-120-presentation-20261028","slug":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university","basisSha256":"86f34606cfb89445028c2a6b3f137815945958bd08b67006ac8bcd6a423bd44d","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","currentRecordSha256":"fbd32e4fb0ba40592aa6ea6801fad5dae7a8feeda82f97f9b89b50aff34587a9","currentClaimIds":["cl-shanghai-jiao-tong-university-self-deploy-264","claim-sjtu-ai-ethics-principles","claim-sjtu-ai-four-tier-classification","claim-sjtu-student-ai-compliance","claim-sjtu-teacher-ai-responsibilities","shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-appeal-conflict","shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-course","shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-disclose","shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-integrity","shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-privacy","shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-research","shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-response","shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-teaching","shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-tools"],"themeOrder":["coursework","exams","disclosure","privacy_data","approved_tools","research_publication","academic_integrity","teaching_guidance","security_procurement"],"events":[{"id":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university:v6-reading-rankings-ten-20261027","slug":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university","revision":"v6-reading-rankings-ten-20261027","previousRevision":"qs46-50-v6-r1-20261023","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T19:56:25.315Z","url":"/changes/v6-reading-rankings-ten-20261027/shanghai-jiao-tong-university","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","items":[{"id":"page-presentation","category":"page_update","theme":"other","matchMethod":"explicit_page_update","newText":"Shared V6 reading layout and evidence presentation updated. University policy Claims, original evidence, held decisions and snapshot approvals remain unchanged; the institution audit remains PARTIAL.","sourceUrls":[]}],"counts":{"affected":0,"held":0,"added":0,"modified":0},"gaps":[],"provenance":[{"kind":"scoped","sha256":"773331b84b010670a4451300d8a6f8d755331065357583a5c9a797331cbe4480"}]},{"id":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university:qs46-50-v6-r1-20261023","slug":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university","revision":"qs46-50-v6-r1-20261023","previousRevision":"public-release-20260924-002","publishedAt":"2026-10-23T21:18:10.827043Z","url":"/changes/qs46-50-v6-r1-20261023/shanghai-jiao-tong-university","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","items":[{"id":"claim:cl-shanghai-jiao-tong-university-self-deploy-264","category":"tracker_correction","theme":"ai_tool_treatment","claimId":"cl-shanghai-jiao-tong-university-self-deploy-264","matchMethod":"claim_id","oldText":"DeepSeek 本地版 is listed for Shanghai Jiao Tong University in an official university AI tools source. Derived availability: not mentioned. Derived endorsement type: self hosted system.","newText":"Official SJTU Xflops materials list a locally deployed DeepSeek service, supported by the Xflops team and the Network Information Center, with DeepSeek/Qwen models. The page does not establish eligibility, price, retention or assessment permission.","comparison":"exact_claim_id","sourceUrls":["https://xflops.sjtu.edu.cn/hpc-start-guide/info-lit/get-info-efficiently/"]},{"id":"claim:claim-sjtu-ai-ethics-principles","category":"tracker_correction","theme":"other","claimId":"claim-sjtu-ai-ethics-principles","matchMethod":"claim_id","oldText":"上海交通大学“AI+教育教学”规范列出基本原则，其中包括技术以人为本、以学为本，发展有利于学生知识能力增长和教师教学育人的人工智能技术。","newText":"SJTU’s 2025 trial AI-in-education guidance adopts human-centered and learning-centered principles for AI used in teaching and learning.","comparison":"exact_claim_id","sourceUrls":["https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm","https://www.sjtu.edu.cn/resource/upload/202503/20250304_105048_720.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:claim-sjtu-ai-four-tier-classification","category":"tracker_correction","theme":"ai_tool_treatment","claimId":"claim-sjtu-ai-four-tier-classification","matchMethod":"claim_id","oldText":"上海交通大学将高等教育教学领域的人工智能应用按应用风险划分为四种类型:禁止使用、有限使用、鼓励使用、开放使用。","newText":"SJTU’s 2025 trial guidance classifies educational AI uses as prohibited, limited, encouraged or open. Specific scenario conditions and lists must be checked separately; the categories are not a blanket permission.","comparison":"exact_claim_id","sourceUrls":["https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm","https://www.sjtu.edu.cn/resource/upload/202503/20250304_105048_720.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:claim-sjtu-student-ai-compliance","category":"tracker_correction","theme":"academic_integrity","claimId":"claim-sjtu-student-ai-compliance","matchMethod":"claim_id","oldText":"上海交通大学规定学生应了解并遵守各课程的人工智能使用规范，在课堂学习、作业反馈等环节遵循教学计划、知识产权法律法规和学术诚信要求；未经授权使用在线学习支持平台等行为被列为学术不端的一类。","newText":"Students must follow the AI-use rules specified for each course and comply with teaching plans, intellectual-property requirements and academic integrity. SJTU’s separate teaching-center guide offers teacher-facing examples; it is not itself a university-wide disciplinary offence list.","comparison":"exact_claim_id","sourceUrls":["https://ctld.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/article/2024/11/41f76c41d972b32fa344023b5663b275.pdf","https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm","https://www.sjtu.edu.cn/resource/upload/202503/20250304_105048_720.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:claim-sjtu-teacher-ai-responsibilities","category":"tracker_correction","theme":"teaching","claimId":"claim-sjtu-teacher-ai-responsibilities","matchMethod":"claim_id","oldText":"上海交通大学规定教师是 AI+ 教学设计的第一责任人，应在遵守教育教学相关规章制度前提下合理、合规、有效使用人工智能技术产品或服务，并围绕场景应用、风险提示、应急预案等环节设置具体规范。","newText":"Teachers are primarily responsible for AI-supported teaching design. They must observe applicable educational rules, specify scenarios and risks, provide testing/validation reports and filing when necessary, and explain course AI scope and AI-generated-content citation formats to students; SJTU may pursue responsibility for unregistered or risky tools.","comparison":"exact_claim_id","sourceUrls":["https://ctld.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/file/2023/12/2b30798c781f304ebfc83e66faef31fe.pdf","https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm","https://www.sjtu.edu.cn/resource/upload/202503/20250304_105048_720.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-appeal-conflict","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","themes":["academic_integrity"],"claimId":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-appeal-conflict","matchMethod":"none","newText":"The2024 integrity code states five-working-day objections after notification and refers disciplinary appeals to the student appeal rules. Separately,2025 discipline and2017 appeal texts use different deadlines. Their cross-document priority remains unresolved here; preserve the decision and seek the applicable route rather than merging clocks.","sourceUrls":["https://gk.sjtu.edu.cn/Phone/View/3867"]},{"id":"claim:shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-course","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"coursework","themes":["coursework","exams"],"claimId":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-course","matchMethod":"none","newText":"SJTU’s2025 trial framework classifies uses as prohibited, limited, encouraged or open; students must follow each course’s AI rules. Teachers publish scope and citation formats through syllabus/class/grading rules. Categories are not permission for every assignment or exam.","sourceUrls":["https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm"]},{"id":"claim:shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-disclose","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"disclosure","themes":["disclosure"],"claimId":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-disclose","matchMethod":"none","newText":"Students should mark and cite necessary information about AI tools; the instructor explains applicable citation templates and permitted uses. Citation does not authorize prohibited use.","sourceUrls":["https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm"]},{"id":"claim:shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-integrity","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","themes":["academic_integrity"],"claimId":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-integrity","matchMethod":"none","newText":"The2024 academic-integrity code supersedes2021. Dishonesty in an assignment/lab assessment results in zero for that component; repeated dishonesty in one course gives a course zero. The retake maximum60 applies when dishonesty led to disciplinary punishment, not every AI use. Joint programmes may have separately filed rules.","sourceUrls":["https://gk.sjtu.edu.cn/Phone/View/3867"]},{"id":"claim:shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-privacy","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"privacy_data","themes":["privacy_data","security_procurement"],"claimId":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-privacy","matchMethod":"none","newText":"The trial framework forbids privacy violations and information theft in AI development/use contexts and requires school approval or filing when using school public data. It does not establish a full vendor-training or retention matrix.","sourceUrls":["https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm"]},{"id":"claim:shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-research","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"research_publication","themes":["research_publication"],"claimId":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-research","matchMethod":"none","newText":"The2025 graduate academic standards have a separate research/degree misconduct and review framework for current postgraduates and prior SJTU postgraduate degree holders. They do not grant blanket AI thesis/publication permission.","sourceUrls":["https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/post/detail/Z3MzMzg5"]},{"id":"claim:shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-response","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","themes":["academic_integrity"],"claimId":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-response","matchMethod":"none","newText":"The2025 disciplinary process gives students an opportunity to respond; a hearing may be requested within three working days from receipt of the proposed disciplinary decision. This is a proposed-decision hearing clock, not the final-decision appeal deadline.","sourceUrls":["https://gs.sjtu.edu.cn/post/detail/Z3MzODAx"]},{"id":"claim:shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-teaching","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"teaching_guidance","themes":["teaching_guidance","security_procurement"],"claimId":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-teaching","matchMethod":"none","newText":"Teachers carry primary responsibility for AI-supported design, explain use scope and risks, and provide testing/filing where necessary. This does not approve every external product.","sourceUrls":["https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm"]},{"id":"claim:shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-tools","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"approved_tools","themes":["approved_tools"],"claimId":"shanghai-jiao-tong-university-local-20261023-tools","matchMethod":"none","newText":"SJTU Xflops documents a locally deployed DeepSeek service supported by Xflops/Network Information Center, with named models. Eligibility, price, vendor/log retention and task authorization are not established by the listing.","sourceUrls":["https://xflops.sjtu.edu.cn/hpc-start-guide/info-lit/get-info-efficiently/"]},{"id":"source:https://ctld.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/article/2024/11/41f76c41d972b32fa344023b5663b275.pdf","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://ctld.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/article/2024/11/41f76c41d972b32fa344023b5663b275.pdf"]},{"id":"source:https://ctld.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/file/2023/12/2b30798c781f304ebfc83e66faef31fe.pdf","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://ctld.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/file/2023/12/2b30798c781f304ebfc83e66faef31fe.pdf"]},{"id":"source:https://ctldnew.sjtu.edu.cn/news/detail/1143","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://ctldnew.sjtu.edu.cn/news/detail/1143"]},{"id":"source:https://gk.sjtu.edu.cn/Data/View/723","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://gk.sjtu.edu.cn/Data/View/723"]},{"id":"source:https://gk.sjtu.edu.cn/Phone/View/3867","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://gk.sjtu.edu.cn/Phone/View/3867"]},{"id":"source:https://gs.sjtu.edu.cn/post/detail/Z3MzODAx","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://gs.sjtu.edu.cn/post/detail/Z3MzODAx"]},{"id":"source:https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://plan.sjtu.edu.cn/info/1025/4295.htm"]},{"id":"source:https://soe.sjtu.edu.cn/kindeditor/Upload/file/20240924/202409241752088876670.pdf","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://soe.sjtu.edu.cn/kindeditor/Upload/file/20240924/202409241752088876670.pdf"]},{"id":"source:https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/post/detail/Z3MzMzg5","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/post/detail/Z3MzMzg5"]},{"id":"source:https://www.sjtu.edu.cn/resource/upload/202503/20250304_105048_720.pdf","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://www.sjtu.edu.cn/resource/upload/202503/20250304_105048_720.pdf"]},{"id":"source:https://xflops.sjtu.edu.cn/hpc-start-guide/info-lit/get-info-efficiently/","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://xflops.sjtu.edu.cn/hpc-start-guide/info-lit/get-info-efficiently/"]}],"counts":{"affected":14,"held":0,"added":9,"modified":5},"gaps":[],"provenance":[{"kind":"record_repair","sha256":"ab6a9dca77f13fe8ddca88f62bda8bc011adbd74bc6aa67bbe61baf6191b547c"},{"kind":"record_repair","sha256":"e02e2fa